# Capacitor mobile wrapper (see docs/MOBILE_APPS.md)
# mobile/www is a generated copy of index.html/css/js/assets -- see scripts/mobile/sync-www.mjs.
# android/ and ios/ ARE committed (standard Capacitor practice: they hold app-specific config
# like icons, permissions, and signing references that `cap add` alone won't reproduce), but
# their own machine-specific / regenerable build output is not.
mobile/www/
android/.gradle/
android/local.properties
android/app/build/
android/build/
android/**/build/
android/captures/
ios/App/Pods/
ios/App/build/
ios/App/output/
ios/App/*.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
ios/App/*.xcodeproj/xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
DerivedData/
